  characterName: ' Siriya Bandara'
  promptText: "Protest has been criminalized: fines, arrests and job loss follow
    public demonstrations. Organising may defend human rights and the people living
    under occupation around the globe but could endanger my family\u2019s stability
    if I am detained."
  leftAnswer: Continuing to organise can defend the commons and inspire broader support.
  rightAnswer: Stepping back preserves family safety and keeps capacity for future
    action.
